    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí está la consulta SQL para BigQuery que cuenta las ocurrencias de las razones de interrupción de tratamientos farmacológicos que ha seleccionado:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    t1.observation_concept_id,\n    t2.concept_name,\n    COUNT(*) AS concept_count\nFROM\n    `observation` AS t1\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS t2\nON\n    t1.observation_concept_id = t2.concept_id\nWHERE\n    t1.observation_concept_id IN (603227, 4057412, 4057423, 4326195)\nGROUP BY\n    t1.observation_concept_id, t2.concept_name\nORDER BY\n    concept_count DESC;\n```",
